      <div class="prose">
        <p>As the national peak body for economic development professionals, EDA represents over 2,500 members, giving sponsors access to a highly engaged and influential national network.</p>
        <p>With the theme <em>Place to Prosperity: Innovation, Transition and Investment Attraction</em>, NEDC26 brings together economic developers, urban shapers, policymakers, economists, place makers, and industry development, investment attraction, innovation and cluster specialists from across the country.</p>
        <p>For sponsors, NEDC26 offers an opportunity to build authentic, high value connections with the people shaping Australia's local and regional economies. The 2026 prospectus features a wide range of opportunities to position your organisation strongly.</p>
        <p>Join us in Hobart, on the traditional lands of the Muwinina and Palawa people, for one of Australia's most exciting conversations about growth, change and prosperity.</p>
